{"schema_version":"1.0","language":"en","edition":"en-ak","revision":"0","book":{"position":20,"code":"PRO","name":"Proverbs","testament":"OT"},"chapter":29,"content":[{"type":"para","marker":"p","content":[{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"1","sid":"PRO 29:1"},"He, that being often reproved hardeneth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," neck, shall suddenly be destroyed, and that without remedy. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:1"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"2","sid":"PRO 29:2"},"When the righteous are in authority, the people rejoice: but when the wicked beareth rule, the people mourn. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:2"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"3","sid":"PRO 29:3"},"Whoso loveth wisdom rejoiceth his father: but he that keepeth company with harlots spendeth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," substance. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:3"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"4","sid":"PRO 29:4"},"The king by judgment establisheth the land: but he that receiveth gifts overthroweth it. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:4"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"5","sid":"PRO 29:5"},"A man that flattereth his neighbour spreadeth a net for his feet. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:5"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"6","sid":"PRO 29:6"},"In the transgression of an evil man ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is"]}," a snare: but the righteous doth sing and rejoice. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:6"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"7","sid":"PRO 29:7"},"The righteous considereth the cause of the poor: ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["but"]}," the wicked regardeth not to know ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it. "]},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:7"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"8","sid":"PRO 29:8"},"Scornful men bring a city into a snare: but wise ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["men"]}," turn away wrath. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:8"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"9","sid":"PRO 29:9"},{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["If"]}," a wise man contendeth with a foolish man, whether he rage or laugh, ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is"]}," no rest. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:9"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"10","sid":"PRO 29:10"},"The bloodthirsty hate the upright: but the just seek his soul. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:10"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"11","sid":"PRO 29:11"},"A fool uttereth all his mind: but a wise ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["man"]}," keepeth it in till afterwards. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:11"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"12","sid":"PRO 29:12"},"If a ruler hearken to lies, all his servants ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["are"]}," wicked. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:12"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"13","sid":"PRO 29:13"},"The poor and the deceitful man meet together: the LORD lighteneth both their eyes. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:13"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"14","sid":"PRO 29:14"},"The king that faithfully judgeth the poor, his throne shall be established for ever. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:14"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"15","sid":"PRO 29:15"},"The rod and reproof give wisdom: but a child left ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["to himself "]},"bringeth his mother to shame. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:15"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"16","sid":"PRO 29:16"},"When the wicked are multiplied, transgression increaseth: but the righteous shall see their fall. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:16"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"17","sid":"PRO 29:17"},"Correct thy son, and he shall give thee rest; yea, he shall give delight unto thy soul. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:17"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"18","sid":"PRO 29:18"},"Where ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is"]}," no vision, the people perish: but he that keepeth the law, happy ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," he. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:18"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"19","sid":"PRO 29:19"},"A servant will not be corrected by words: for though he understand he will not answer. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:19"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"20","sid":"PRO 29:20"},"Seest thou a man ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["that is"]}," hasty in his words? ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["there is "]},"more hope of a fool than of him. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:20"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"21","sid":"PRO 29:21"},"He that delicately bringeth up his servant from a child shall have him become ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["his"]}," son at the length. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:21"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"22","sid":"PRO 29:22"},"An angry man stirreth up strife, and a furious man aboundeth in transgression. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:22"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"23","sid":"PRO 29:23"},"A man’s pride shall bring him low: but honour shall uphold the humble in spirit. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:23"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"24","sid":"PRO 29:24"},"Whoso is partner with a thief hateth his own soul: he heareth cursing, and bewrayeth ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["it"]}," not. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:24"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"25","sid":"PRO 29:25"},"The fear of man bringeth a snare: but whoso putteth his trust in the LORD shall be safe. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:25"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"26","sid":"PRO 29:26"},"Many seek the ruler’s favour; but ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["every"]}," man’s judgment ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["cometh"]}," from the LORD. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:26"},{"type":"verse","marker":"v","number":"27","sid":"PRO 29:27"},"An unjust man ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," an abomination to the just: and ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["he that is"]}," upright in the way ",{"type":"char","marker":"add","content":["is"]}," abomination to the wicked. ",{"type":"verse","marker":"v","eid":"PRO 29:27"}]}]}
